# Running heads, footers and page numbers stay out of a copy of body text, and selecting only a running head copies it (owner, 2026-11-07). No event is posted: these go through what a real press, drag and release call.
# recto qa run <a copy of app/qa/chrome.qa in a temp folder, where a quiet run reads scripts>, with RECTO_QA_PDF set to a PDF of at least 3 pages, each with "Annual report" as a running head about 38 points down, body text from about 98 points down and its page number at the foot: the made report in `the_chrome_script_passes` is one.
open "$RECTO_QA_PDF"
qa wait-settled --timeout 30s
qa zoom 0.5
qa wait-settled --timeout 30s
# A drag from page 1's body over the page break into page 2's.
qa mouse-down 1:80,98
qa mouse-drag 2:300,112
qa mouse-up
qa wait-settled --timeout 30s
qa menu edit.copy
qa wait-settled --timeout 30s
qa copied
expect-contains untrusted.text Body
expect-lacks untrusted.text Annual
# A triple-click on page 2's running head, and only that.
qa mouse-down 2:80,38:3
qa mouse-up
qa wait-settled --timeout 30s
qa menu edit.copy
qa wait-settled --timeout 30s
qa copied
expect-contains untrusted.text Annual
qa state
expect hangs.over_2s 0
